#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/cdn.rst:2
msgid "Content Delivery Network (CDN) and caching"
msgstr "内容分发网络（CDN）与缓存"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/cdn.rst:4
msgid ""
"A CDN is used for making documentation pages *fast* for your users. CDNs "
"increase speed by caching documentation content in multiple data centers "
"around the world, and then serving docs from the data center closest to the "
"user."
msgstr "CDN 用于让文档页面对你的用户而言更*快速*。CDN 通过在全球多个数据中心缓存文档内容来提速，然后从离用户最近的数据中心提供文档。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/cdn.rst:8
msgid "We support CDNs on both of our sites:"
msgstr "我们在两个站点上都支持 CDN："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/cdn.rst:10
msgid "On |org_brand|,"
msgstr "在 |org_brand| 上，"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/cdn.rst:11
msgid ""
"we are able to provide a CDN to all the projects that we host. This service "
"is graciously sponsored by `Cloudflare`_."
msgstr "我们能为托管的所有项目提供 CDN 服务。此服务由 `Cloudflare`_ 慷慨赞助。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/cdn.rst:13
msgid "On |com_brand|,"
msgstr "在 |com_brand| 上，"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/cdn.rst:14
msgid ""
"the CDN is included as part of all of our plans. We use `Cloudflare`_ for "
"this as well."
msgstr "CDN 包含在我们所有套餐中，同样使用 `Cloudflare`_。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/cdn.rst:18
msgid "CDN benefits"
msgstr "CDN 优势"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/cdn.rst:20
msgid "Having a CDN in front of your documentation has many benefits:"
msgstr "在文档前部署 CDN 有诸多优势："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/cdn.rst:22
msgid ""
"**Improved reliability**: Since docs are served from multiple places, one "
"can go down and the docs are still accessible."
msgstr "**更高可靠性**：由于文档从多个位置提供服务，单点故障时文档仍可访问。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/cdn.rst:23
msgid ""
"**Improved performance**: Data takes time to travel across space, so "
"connecting to a server closer to the user makes documentation load faster."
msgstr "**更高性能**：数据传输需要时间，连接到离用户更近的服务器可加快文档加载。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/cdn.rst:26
msgid "Automatic cache refresh"
msgstr "自动刷新缓存"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/cdn.rst:28
msgid ""
"We automatically refresh the cache on the CDN when the following actions "
"happen:"
msgstr "发生以下操作时我们会自动刷新 CDN 缓存："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/cdn.rst:30
msgid "Your project is saved."
msgstr "项目被保存。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/cdn.rst:31
msgid "Your domain is saved."
msgstr "域名被保存。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/cdn.rst:32
msgid "A new version of your documentation is built."
msgstr "文档的新版本构建完成。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/cdn.rst:34
msgid ""
"By refreshing the cache according to these rules, readers should **never see"
" outdated content**. This makes the end-user experience seamless and fast."
msgstr "按这些规则刷新缓存，读者**绝不会看到过时内容**。这让最终用户体验连贯且快速。"

